{"resourceIdentifier":"3625","resourceName":"Yangdong Landfill Gas Power Generation Project","description":"The purpose of the project is to use LFG, which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system, and electricity generation system. The project started to construct on 28/10/2020. The total installed capacity of the project is 5.0MW, consisting of 10 sets of 500kW generator, LFG collected is used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators to generate about 207,912 MWh supplying to CSPG during the first 7 years crediting period. The expected average annual emission reductions are 181,670 tCO2e and the total emission reductions are 1,271,691 tCO2e during the 7-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":21.943055,"longitude":112.046385},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-07","endExclusive":"2022-12-08","endInclusive":"2022-12-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3625"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yangjiang Yangdong Huanyu New Energy Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3625"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"129487"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21/06/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_P